19
00:01:04.376 --> 00:01:05.251
Problem:

20
00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:12.805
LFU cache with O(1) get or put: evict the least frequently used key; ties - least recently used among them.

21
00:01:15.655 --> 00:01:16.594
Part 4.

22
00:01:16.874 --> 00:01:17.706
