00:06:06.394 --> 00:06:27.919
Interview, and Production (Spring Boot 4). single-threaded class: one ReentrantLock (a get also mutates frequency buckets, so reads need it too). callers call get or put: @Cacheable(sync = true): concurrent misses load once (no cache stampede). no invalidation: @CacheEvict on writes. pure LFU (old popular items stick forever):

96
00:06:28.199 --> 00:06:33.383
Caffeine W-TinyLFU: frequency sketch with ageing + LRU window.

97
00:06:33.663 --> 00:06:35.093
